# darksamus_render.py's driver: the beam made and updated in front of the player (25 frames apart:
# the driver polls about every 24 frames and drops lines in between).
@f600 send u04f7 Activate; god 1
@f625 place u04f7 player 10
@f650 statecall u04f7 PhazonAttack 0 0.016; uevent u04f7 27
@f675 place u04f7 player 10; statecall u04f7 PhazonAttack 1 0.05
@f700 place u04f7 player 10; statecall u04f7 PhazonAttack 1 0.05
@f725 place u04f7 player 10; statecall u04f7 PhazonAttack 1 0.05
@f750 place u04f7 player 10; statecall u04f7 PhazonAttack 1 0.05
@f775 place u04f7 player 10; statecall u04f7 PhazonAttack 1 0.05
@f800 status
